  "content": "<h1>DarkTides</h1>\n<p><strong>描述</strong></p>\n<p>在副手装备钻石铲，化身美人鱼！</p>\n<p><em>支持服务端。您可以仅安装在服务端上，无需在客户端安装。</em></p>\n<p>由制作 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG</a> 的同一团队打造（欲获完整RPG体验，请下载 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG整合包</a>，享受任务与RPG玩法）</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>功能特性</h2>\n<p>(这些功能将进一步优化您的原版游戏体验)</p>\n<p>在水槽中放置水桶，执行命令 <strong>/trigger breathe</strong> 即可获得水下呼吸、夜视和快速游泳状态效果</p>\n<p>状态效果持续5分钟，可重复激活。</p>\n<h2>起源联动</h2>\n<p>基于水的<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/origins\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Origins</a>模组（如Merling）将获得此模组的加成——现在您可在陆地上行走而不会受损。计时结束后，返回水域即可重新激活。<span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1140/968/screenshot-2025-03-27-211934-png.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1140/969/2025-03-27_21-21-11-png.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1140/970/2025-03-27_21-21-36-png.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">立即获取服务器并与朋友畅玩！点击 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a> 或下方横幅并使用代码 <strong>GAMERPOTION</strong> 享受25%优惠！</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
